4. CUSTOM ICON SYSTEM (CRITICAL)
Create components/icons.tsx. Every icon is an inline SVG function component. Do NOT import icons from any library. Draw fresh paths — do not copy from Lucide, Heroicons, or Feather. These icons have thicker strokes (2.25px vs typical 2px) which gives them a distinctive, confident mobile feel.

Universal rules for every icon:

viewBox="0 0 24 24"

fill="none"

stroke="currentColor"

strokeWidth={2.25}

strokeLinecap="round"

strokeLinejoin="round"

Accept props: { size?: number; className?: string } with defaults size=24, className=""

Apply width={size} height={size} and className={className} to the <svg>

Required icons (build every one):

IconPower — Lightning bolt with flat top and bottom edges, not zigzag. Sharp, confident silhouette.

IconWater — Droplet outline with one subtle inner wave curve suggesting water inside.

IconFood — Bowl outline with three short steam arcs above it.

IconRoad — Perspective road: two converging vertical curves with 3 dashed center segments.

IconFlood — Three stacked horizontal wave lines with slight phase offset.

IconReport — Rounded square outline with a bold plus sign centered inside.

IconLocation — Classic map pin with a hollow circle in the middle.

IconClock — Circle outline with two hands at the 10:10 position.

IconCheck — Checkmark with a slight curved tail (not perfectly straight).

IconAlert — Triangle outline with a bold exclamation line inside (no dot below).

IconBell — Bell outline with a single short horizontal line below (clapper).

IconHome — Simple house: flat roof line, side walls, small door rectangle.

IconList — Three horizontal lines of equal length with a small dot to the left of each.

IconHelp — Lifebuoy: outer circle, inner circle, four short spokes at 45°, 135°, 225°, 315°.

IconPhone — Classic handset outline (rotated receiver shape).

IconArrowRight — Horizontal line with a chevron head on the right end.

IconClose — X with rounded line caps.

IconChevronDown — Single chevron pointing down.

IconPeople — Two overlapping head-and-shoulder silhouettes (stroke only).

IconTruck — Water tanker: cab rectangle on left, cylindrical tank on right, two wheels below.

Example template:

tsx
export function IconPower({ size = 24, className = "" }: { size?: number; className?: string }) {
  return (
    <svg width={size} height={size} viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         strokeWidth="2.25" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" className={className}>
      {/* your fresh path data here — do not copy from any library */}
    </svg>
  );
}
