9. INTERACTION & STATE PATTERNS
Every screen must handle these states. Do not skip any.

Loading:

Simulate 800ms loading on first data fetch per screen (Updates, Help, Dashboard, NGO).

Use a skeleton: 2–3 grey rounded rectangles in Card shape, pulsing gently with animate-pulse.

Never show a spinner longer than 1s — this is a demo.

Empty:

Every list has an EmptyState (Section 5.13) with a helpful icon, heading, body, and optional action.

Error:

Form validation: if a Button is pressed with invalid input, show inline error text below the input: 12px / --color-danger / mt-1.

No alert() calls, ever.

Success:

Use Toast component (5.14). Auto-dismiss at 3s. Never a browser alert().

Press feedback:

All buttons and cards: active:scale-[0.98] transition-transform duration-100. No hover styles (mobile-first).

Focus states:

All focusable elements: focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#003DA5] focus-visible:outline-offset-2.

